        "Kei te whakaae mātou ki te tauākī a te USOC ko ngā pānga o ā mātou kaioma, karapū hoki, tae atu ki tā rātou momo hākinakina, ka pai ake te tautoko i a rātou mā te koke whakamua ki te panoni whai tikanga ki roto tonu i tō tātou whakahaere, kaua ko te whakakore tiwhikete.",
        "Ko te Three Kingdoms tētahi o ngā wā tino rere te toto i te hītori o Ancient China i mate ngā tini mano tāngata e whawhai ana kia noho ki te tūru teitei rawa ki te whare kīngi whakahira ki Xi'an.",
        "Ko ētahi ingoa kē atu kua whakaurungia ko te Pikitia Pai, te kaihautu, te kiriataata, te Hoahoa Tākahu, te Whakatika Kiriata, te Tohu Tuatahi, te Hanga Hoahoa, te Whakapai Oro, te Whakaranu Oro me te Kiriata Taketakenga.",
        "I hangaia e ngā Babylon he temepara mō ia o ō rātou atua, ā, i whakapono koinaka tonu te kāinga o te atua raka.",
        "He pērā rawa te tino riki rawa o ngā ngota ka taea e ngā tini tiriona ngota te noho ki roto i te irakati ki te mutunga o tēnei rerenga.",
        "Ka mākū koe mēna koe ka whakawhiti i te piriti, ka hīkoi rānei i te huarahi kōpikopiko e tata ana ki te wairere.",
        "Pēnei i ētahi atu tōhunga, kei te ruarua kē ōna mahara e pā ana ki te whakaora i te mate huka, me te mōhio iho kāore ēnei kōrero e hāngai ana ki te hunga kua pāngia kētia ki te mate huka momo 1.",
        "Mai rā anō kua ngana a Luxembourg kia noho tonu hei whenua ngū engari i nohoia e Tiamani i te Pakanga Tuatahi o te Ao me te Pakanga Tuarua o te Ao.",
        "I a koe ka noho ki tēnei rohe, ka taea e koe te whakawhiti i ngā rohe, ā, ehara i te mea me haere anō mā ngā tirotiro kaitiaki uruwhenua.",
        "Ki te whāngai, ka motu ngā mātua whakawhānau i ō rātou motika ā-mātua kia whakatipuria te tamaiti e tētahi atu tokorua.",
        "Kei te pūrongotia ko tōna 9400 ngā kāinga ki te takiwā kua kore wai, ā, tata ki te 100 kua kore hiko.",
        "Ahakoa i tangi a Winfrey i tōna wehenga, ko tāna ki ana kaitautoko ka hoki mai anō ia.",
        "Ka tika tō tātou taumata-tuatahi hāwhe-mira, he tāne e āhei te pīti i te rua miniti, kāore e kore he mōhio ki te tere, heoi me ngaki te manawanui i ngā raru katoa.",
        "I whakatūria te Couchsurfing i te Kohitātea o te tau 2004 i muri i te hoko a te kaiwhakaite rorohiko a Casey Fenton i tētahi rerenga iti te utu ki Tiorangi engari kāore tōna wāhi noho.",
        "Kua rangahaua te wā e ngā hāhi, e ngā kai rapunga whakaaro, me ngā mātanga o te pūtaiao mō ngā tau manomano.",
        "Ka pērā anō tēnei i ngā āhuatanga e whā o te matū (ki te raupapa ōrite): arā te totoka, te wē, te hau, te wētoto, ahakoa kua puta te ariā i a ia ka panoni ēnei ki ngā matū hou hei hanga i ngā mea e kitea ana e tātou.",
        "Whai muri i te kotahi wiki o ngā hinganga ki te kōwhiringa pōti waenga wā, nā Bush i whaki atu ki tētahi minenga mō te whakawhānuitanga o te hokohoko ki Āhia.",
        "Tāria te wā, ā muri i ngā tini mano tau, tini miriona tau rānei pea, ka pērā te rerekē o te āhua o ngā taupori e rua e kore e taea te kīia kotahi tonu te momo.",
